{"id":"441356","name":"虾肉蛋羹","author":"厨娘宋宋","authorId":"9823148","desc":"","cover":"images/441356/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"大虾","amount":"两个"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"两个"}],"sub":[{"name":"料酒","amount":"两茶匙"},{"name":"盐","amount":"三分之一茶匙"},{"name":"味极鲜","amount":"一茶匙"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡蛋两个加入盐料酒调匀备用。","img":"images/441356/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入鸡蛋一点五倍的温水调匀。","img":"images/441356/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"用细漏勺过滤两次。","img":"images/441356/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"倒入两个小碗，上锅大火烧开蒸十五分钟。","img":"images/441356/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"利用蒸制时间把大虾肉剥出来。","img":"images/441356/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"剁碎备用。","img":"images/441356/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"将剁好的虾肉放入蛋羹继续蒸五分钟。","img":"images/441356/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"取出浇上蒸鱼豉油，撒上葱花即可。","img":"images/441356/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/441356/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}